    apply: "Prepare to bring something to the next gathering that will build up others, such as a Scripture, a song, a testimony or a prayer. Arrive early to welcome someone. Ask your leaders how you can help to make the gathering clear and welcoming.",
    activity: "Ask the class to plan a short service using Paul's principles, assigning a hymn, a lesson, a prayer, a testimony and welcome. Discuss what each contributes to building up. Read 1 Corinthians 14:26 and 40 and evaluate the plan against them.",
    takeHome: "Read 1 Corinthians 14:1-40, Colossians 3:12-17 and Acts 2:42-47. Write suggestions for improving the welcome in your church. Memorise 1 Corinthians 14:40.",
