    teacher: "Different churches have different forms of worship, so avoid criticising other styles. Draw principles rather than a single form. Encourage learners to support their leaders and to offer suggestions kindly.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners the guiding rule for gatherings in 1 Corinthians 14.",
    mcq1: ["What is the guiding rule in 1 Corinthians 14:26?", ["Let all things be done for building up", "Let each do as he pleases", "Let none speak", "Let leaders speak only"], 0, "Everything must build up."],
