    sa: ["What principles for gatherings does Paul give in 1 Corinthians 14?", ["build up", "order", "peace", "interpret", "turn", "welcome"], "A good answer says everything should build up, participation should be orderly with one at a time and interpretation, messages should be weighed, and God is a God of peace."],
