    apply: "Write a short letter to yourself with your commitments for the next three months and give it to a trusted friend to return to you. Choose one ministry to join and one person to encourage. Continue the memory verses and review them weekly.",
    activity: "Hold a circle of thanksgiving, where each learner shares one thing they learned and one step they will take. Then the teacher or pastor prays for each learner in turn, or the class prays together, asking for the Spirit's blessing on their gifts. Sing a closing song and share a simple meal if possible.",
    takeHome: "Review your commitments weekly. Read 1 Corinthians 15:50-58, Philippians 1 and Jude 17-25. Memorise 1 Corinthians 15:58 and plan which course to take next.",
